    en: "**VQF**: in how many seconds tilt follows the accelerometer.\nLess is faster but more sensitive to vibration\nRange 0.1-30",
    zh: "**VQF**：倾斜向加速度计收敛所需的秒数。\n越小越快，但更易受振动影响\n范围 0.1-30",
